I am informed by the Departments of National Defence and Defence Production as follows:
(a)	$13,200,000 (Canada's share $1,740,000);
(b)	1954; (c) Ten years; (d) 1964, as it became redundant due to increased coverage of other radar sites; (e) By Crown Assets Disposal Corporation to Domaine St. Sylvestre Inc., Victoriaville, Que.; (f) $120,030.
